            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "Crouch + skill key: mark the player under your crosshair (the target gets no notice; can mark multiple; 20-second cooldown per mark).",
                "zh_cn": "蹲下+技能键：标记准星玩家（对方不会收到任何提示，可同时标记多人，每次标记冷却20秒）。",
